From f1967e1fd5e573a2aac72fe7ad6d3f362a55302d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:25:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 39/39] Adapt the product series to Chromium 152 APIs

Keep the 26.5 SDK through an in-tree symlink. Solid-color layers,
extension resource loading, PDF helper frames, print preview ids,
and datalist key handling follow the 152 signatures.
